msgstr "<p>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "<details><summary>Fediverse: <a href=\"https://floss.social/@fdroidorg\">@fdroidorg@floss.social</a></summary>Follow us on our Mastodon and join the conversation.</details>\n"
msgstr "<details><summary>Födiverzum: <a href=\"https://floss.social/@fdroidorg\">@fdroidorg@floss.social</a></summary>Kövessen minket a Mastodonon és csatlakozzon a beszélgetéshez.</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "<details><summary>Matrix: <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid:f-droid.org\">#fdroid:f-droid.org</a>&#8230;</summary>To see all of the F-Droid Matrix rooms, join the \"space\" that groups all F-Droid related rooms together at <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-space:f-droid.org\">#fdroid-space:f-droid.org</a>.</details>\n"
msgstr "<details><summary>Matrix: <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid:f-droid.org\">#fdroid:f-droid.org</a>&#8230;</summary>Hogy lássa az F-Droid Matrix-szobáit, csatlakozzon a térhez, amely összefogja az összes F-Droid-hoz kapcsolódó szobát: <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#fdroid-space:f-droid.org\">#fdroid-space:f-droid.org</a>.</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "<details><summary>Forum: <a href=\"https://forum.f-droid.org/\">forum.f-droid.org</a></summary>Join our free software conversations and get support on Discourse.</details>\n"
msgstr "<details><summary>Fórum: <a href=\"https://forum.f-droid.org/\">forum.f-droid.org</a></summary>Csatlakozzon a szabad szoftveres beszélgetésünkhöz, és kapjon segítséget a Discourse-on.</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "<details><summary>Telegram&#8230;</summary>There is also a Matrix bridge to Telegram, to join it click <a href=\"https://matrix.f-droid.org/fdroid/telegram/\">this link</a>.</details>\n"
msgid "<details><summary>Telegram&#8230;</summary>There is also a Matrix bridge to Telegram, to join it click <a href=\"https://matrix.f-droid.org/fdroid/telegram/\">this link</a>. To join Telegram group chat, click <a href=\"https://t.me/+GvF3pDJmp_RkM2Ni\">this link</a>.</details>\n"
msgstr "<details><summary>Telegram&#8230;</summary>Van egy Matrix-híd is a Telegramhoz, a csatlakozáshoz kattintson <a href=\"https://matrix.f-droid.org/fdroid/telegram/\">erre a hivatkozásra</a>.</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/about.md
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
